{% comment %}
  Pipe-delimited order cards: icon|title|subtitle|detail
  One card per line — looped like a React map.
{% endcomment %}
{% capture order_card_lines %}
⚒|Production|Every case is made to order|Each Celyfos case is built by hand after your order is placed. See the current bench time in shipping details at checkout.
⏰|Processing time|Before it ships|1–5 business days from order confirmation, depending on current bench workload.
📍|Ships from|Athens, Greece|All orders ship directly from the workshop in Athens via international courier.
👤|Manufacturer|The man behind every case|Celyfos SCE — Andrew Vasilas, Founder and Aircraft Engineer.
{% endcapture %}

{% assign order_cards = order_card_lines | strip | split: '
' %}

{% capture page_content %}
  {% for line in order_cards %}
    {% assign line = line | strip %}
    {% if line == blank %}
      {% continue %}
    {% endif %}
    {% assign parts = line | split: '|' %}
    {% render 'order-card',
      icon: parts[0],
      title: parts[1],
      subtitle: parts[2],
      detail: parts[3]
    %}
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="bg-[#F7F0E8] border-[0.5px] border-[#E0D6CA] border-l-[3px] border-l-[#9A7235] rounded-tr-[10px] rounded-br-[10px] py-[14px] px-[18px] text-[14px] text-[#4A4A4A] leading-[1.65] italic !mt-[20px]">
    Questions about your order? Email us at
    <a href="mailto:{{ shop.metafields.custom.email.value }}" class="text-[#9A7235] no-underline">
      {{ shop.metafields.custom.email.value }}
    </a>
    — we’ll always find the best resolution.
  </div>
{% endcapture %}

{% render 'custom-page',
  title: 'Order & Shipping',
  subtitle: 'Made to order · Ships from Athens, Greece',
  content: page_content
%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Ordering & Shipping",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
